[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11346.23, "timestamp": "03:09:06", "text": "过来。等待。等待。嘘。过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11351.63, "timestamp": "03:09:11", "text": "里面。来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11354.87, "timestamp": "03:09:14", "text": "在。坐上去。坐。坐上去。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11358.99, "timestamp": "03:09:18", "text": "开玩笑。过来。这是这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11363.03, "timestamp": "03:09:23", "text": "石氏的展示盒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11366.79, "timestamp": "03:09:26", "text": "是的，你可以从这里喂她。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11369.59, "timestamp": "03:09:29", "text": "等等，我给你举个例子。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11376.83, "timestamp": "03:09:36", "text": "你看，是他成就了我。这样我就可以喂她了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11380.269, "timestamp": "03:09:40", "text": "我会使用 cookie，然后就可以关闭了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11383.99, "timestamp": "03:09:43", "text": "它。是的。为了展示我收取了 20 美元"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11391.11, "timestamp": "03:09:51", "text": "天哪，我忘了还有类似的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11395.53, "timestamp": "03:09:55", "text": "这。我像个老古董一样忘记了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11397.309, "timestamp": "03:09:57", "text": "[音乐]"}]